		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00005 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00005-s " data-id="e00005" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00005">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00006-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00006">01</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00008-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00008">ARCADE BAR — OPEN LATE</p>
		
</div>
			<h1 data-interaction-id="e00009" class="e-1c1mrqs-e00009-s e-heading-base">44 Cabinets. All Free Play. No Queue For Change.</h1>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000a">A bar with a properly restored arcade attached, not an arcade with a bar bolted on. Every cabinet is on free play from the moment you walk in. You pay for drinks and that is it.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000b-s " data-id="e0000b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000b">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c"><a href="#floor" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		See what is on the floor
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d"><a href="#find-us" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Where we are
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000g-s" data-interaction-id="e0000g" id="178" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Rows of lit arcade cabinets on the Quarter Inserted floor"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000h-s " data-id="e0000h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000h">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">OPENING HOURS</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000j-s " data-id="e0000j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000j">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000k">Monday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000l">Closed</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000m-s " data-id="e0000m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000m">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">Tuesday — Thursday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000o">4pm — midnight</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000q">Friday — Saturday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000r">noon — 2am</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000s-s " data-id="e0000s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000s">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000t">Sunday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">noon — 11pm</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0000v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000v">Free play the whole time we are open. No tokens, no change machine, no jar of quarters by the door.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    
</div>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000x-s " data-id="e0000x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000x" id="floor">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0000z-s " data-id="e0000z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00010 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00010-s " data-id="e00010" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00010">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00012-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00012">02</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00013 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00013-s " data-id="e00013" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00013">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00014-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00014">THE FLOOR</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00015" class="e-1c1mrqs-e00015-s e-heading-base">The Floor</h2>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00016-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00016">Original boards where we could get them, faithful reproductions where we could not, and we say which is which on the marquee. Six pinball tables, all levelled weekly by someone who cares far too much.</p>
		
</div>
