<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003d-s " data-id="e0003d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003d" id="drinks">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003e-s " data-id="e0003e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003f-s " data-id="e0003f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003g-s " data-id="e0003g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003g">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003h">03</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003i-s " data-id="e0003i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003i">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003j">THE BAR</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003k" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003k-s e-heading-base">On Tap</h2>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003l">Eight taps, four of them local, two lagers that are actually good, and no cocktail menu. We would rather pour you a decent pint in ninety seconds than a negroni in six minutes.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003m-s " data-id="e0003m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003m">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003n-s" data-interaction-id="e0003n" id="179" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-bar_pour.jpg" width="768" height="1024" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-bar_pour.jpg 768w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-bar_pour-225x300.jpg 225w" alt="A pint being poured behind the Quarter Inserted bar"/>		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003o">Wine is red, white or orange. Soft drinks are proper ones. There is a coffee machine and somebody knows how to use it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003p-s " data-id="e0003p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003r">01</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003s-s " data-id="e0003s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003s">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003t">Hallmark Bitter</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003u">Local. Four miles up the road.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003v">3.8%</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003w-s " data-id="e0003w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003w">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003x">02</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0003y-s " data-id="e0003y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003y">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0003z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003z">Fifth Quarter Pale</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00040-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00040">Local. Brewed for us, badged for us.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00041-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00041">4.4%</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00042 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00042-s " data-id="e00042" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00042">
