			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0004v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004v">5.2%</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0004x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004x">08</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0004y-s " data-id="e0004y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004y">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0004z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004z">The Guest Line</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00050-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00050">Rotates every Tuesday. Ask what is on.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00051-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00051">Varies</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    
</div>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053" id="tournaments">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00055 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00055-s " data-id="e00055" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00055">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">04</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059">TUESDAY AND THURSDAY</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005a" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005a-s e-heading-base">Tournaments</h2>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Tuesday is pinball, Thursday is fighting games, and the leaderboard resets on the first of every month. Winner gets their initials on the wall for a year and a bar tab.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005d-s " data-id="e0005d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005d">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005e">TUESDAY · 7PM</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005f" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005f-s e-heading-base">Pinball Ladder</h3>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005g">Three games, best two of three, on whichever tables come out of the hat at seven. Sign up at the bar from six. Free to enter, capped at thirty-two players.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005h-s " data-id="e0005h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005h">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005i">THURSDAY · 7PM</p>
					<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005j" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005j-s e-heading-base">Fighting Games</h3>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005k">Double elimination on the cabinet, not on a console. Game rotates monthly between Super Turbo, KOF ’98 and Accent Core. Sticks are Japanese and they are looked after.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005l-s " data-id="e0005l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005m-s " data-id="e0005m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005m">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005n">LEADERBOARD RULES</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005o-s " data-id="e0005o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005o">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p"><strong>One.</strong> Scores only count if a member of staff sees the screen before it is cleared.</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q"><strong>Two.</strong> Three initials, no more, and we reserve the right to refuse the funny ones.</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r"><strong>Three.</strong> Everything resets at open on the first of the month. Nothing carries over.</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s"><strong>Four.</strong> The month’s top score on each tournament machine goes on the wall for a year, plus a fifty pound tab.</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0005t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005t"><strong>Five.</strong> Ties are settled on the machine, that night, in one game. No sharing the wall.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005v-s" data-interaction-id="e0005v" id="180" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-pinball_hands.jpg" width="512" height="512" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-pinball_hands.jpg 512w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-pinball_hands-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-pinball_hands-150x150.jpg 150w" alt="Hands on the flipper buttons of a pinball table"/>		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005w-s " data-id="e0005w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005w">
    
</div>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005x-s " data-id="e0005x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005x" id="hire">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005y-s " data-id="e0005y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00060 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00060-s " data-id="e00060" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00060">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061">05</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00062 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00062-s " data-id="e00062" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00062">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00063-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00063">PRIVATE HIRE</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00064" class="e-1c1mrqs-e00064-s e-heading-base">The Whole Floor</h2>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065">Whole floor hire for up to 120 people, Sunday to Wednesday, from 900 including a welcome round. All 44 cabinets and all six tables stay on free play, which is the entire point.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00066 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00066-s " data-id="e00066" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00066">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00067 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00067-s " data-id="e00067" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00067">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068">120</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00069-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00069">PEOPLE, STANDING</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006b">900</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006c">FROM, WELCOME ROUND IN</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006d-s " data-id="e0006d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006d">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006e">Sun</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006f">TO WEDNESDAY</p>
		
</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006g"><a href="mailto:hire@quarterinserted.co.uk" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		hire@quarterinserted.co.uk
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006h">Pizza for the room is quoted per head. Thursday and the weekend stay open to everybody — we are not shutting the floor on a Friday, sorry.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006i-s " data-id="e0006i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006i">
    			<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006j-s" data-interaction-id="e0006j" id="178" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-quarter-inserted-arcade_floor-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Rows of lit arcade cabinets on the Quarter Inserted floor"/>		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006k-s " data-id="e0006k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006k">
    
</div>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006l-s " data-id="e0006l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006l" id="food">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006m-s " data-id="e0006m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006m">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006n-s " data-id="e0006n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006o-s " data-id="e0006o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006p-s " data-id="e0006p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006p">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006q">06</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006r-s " data-id="e0006r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006r">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006s">ONE OVEN, UNTIL 11PM</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0006t" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006t-s e-heading-base">The Oven</h2>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006u">One oven, six pizzas, until 11pm. The one with the fennel sausage is the correct order and the staff will tell you so.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006v">NO STARTERS. NO PUDDINGS. NO CHIPS. THERE IS ONE OVEN AND IT IS BUSY.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006w e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006w-s " data-id="e0006w" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0006w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0006x-s " data-id="e0006x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006x">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006y">01</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0006z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006z">Fennel Sausage</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00070-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00070">The correct order. The staff will tell you so before you finish asking.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00071 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00071-s " data-id="e00071" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00071">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00072-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00072">02</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00073-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00073">Margherita</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00074-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00074">Fior di latte, basil, nothing clever. Twelve inches of restraint.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00075 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00075-s " data-id="e00075" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00075">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00076-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00076">03</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00077-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00077">Nduja and Honey</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00078-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00078">Hot, then sweet, then hot again. Order a Keller Pils with it.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00079 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00079-s " data-id="e00079" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00079">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007a">04</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007b">Mushroom and Taleggio</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007c">No tomato. Thyme, garlic, a lot of black pepper.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007d-s " data-id="e0007d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007d">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007e-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007e">05</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007f">Pepperoni</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007g">Cupped, crisped at the edges, grease in the little bowls. Yes.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007h-s " data-id="e0007h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007h">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007i">06</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007j">Marinara</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007k">No cheese at all. Tomato, oregano, garlic, oil. The purist option.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007l-s " data-id="e0007l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007l">
    
</div>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007m-s " data-id="e0007m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007m" id="rules">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007n-s " data-id="e0007n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007n">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007o-s " data-id="e0007o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007p-s " data-id="e0007p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007p">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007q">07</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007r-s " data-id="e0007r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007r">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007s">HOUSE RULES</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0007t" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007t-s e-heading-base">House Rules</h2>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007u">Over 21 after 8pm. No drinks on the cabinets, and we do mean it. Be decent to whoever is on the machine you want. That is the whole list, and it is not negotiable.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007v-s " data-id="e0007v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007w-s " data-id="e0007w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007w">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007x">01</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0007y-s " data-id="e0007y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007y">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0007z" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0007z-s e-heading-base">Over 21 after 8pm</h3>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00080-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00080">Under-21s are welcome on the floor until 8pm, with an adult, every day we are open. After 8pm it is a bar and we will ask for ID. Bring the real one.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00081 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00081-s " data-id="e00081" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00081">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00082-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00082">02</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00083 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00083-s " data-id="e00083" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00083">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00084" class="e-1c1mrqs-e00084-s e-heading-base">No drinks on the cabinets</h3>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00085-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00085">And we do mean it. There is a shelf beside every machine and a rail along every wall. A spilled pint is a dead board and a dead board is a month of somebody’s evenings.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00086 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00086-s " data-id="e00086" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00086">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00087-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00087">03</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00088 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00088-s " data-id="e00088" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00088">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00089" class="e-1c1mrqs-e00089-s e-heading-base">Be decent to whoever is on the machine</h3>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008a">Coin up on the marquee, stand where they can see you, and wait. No backseat play, no leaning on the cabinet, no reaching over a stranger to hit a button.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008b-s " data-id="e0008b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008b">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008c">04</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008d-s " data-id="e0008d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008d">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0008e" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008e-s e-heading-base">Free play is not a free-for-all</h3>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008f">If there is a queue at a cabinet, it is one game and hand over. Tournament nights, the tournament machines are for the tournament from 7pm.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008g-s " data-id="e0008g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008g">
    
</div>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008h-s " data-id="e0008h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008h" id="find-us">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008i-s " data-id="e0008i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008j-s " data-id="e0008j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008k-s " data-id="e0008k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008k">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008l">08</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008m-s " data-id="e0008m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008m">
    
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008n">FIND US</p>
		
</div>
			<h2 data-interaction-id="e0008o" class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008o-s e-heading-base">Walk In</h2>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008p">No bookings for the main floor, ever. If we are full there is a queue and it moves. Come early on a Friday or come late on a Tuesday and have the place to yourself.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008q-s " data-id="e0008q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008q">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008r">Quarter Inserted</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008s">Unit 4, The Old Print Works</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008t">112 Gasworks Lane</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008u">Manchester M4 6JR</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008v"><a href="tel:+441614960044" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		0161 496 0044
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008w-s " data-id="e0008w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008w">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008x">WHEN WE ARE OPEN</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0008y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0008y-s " data-id="e0008y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0008y">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0008z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0008z">Monday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00090-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00090">Closed</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00091 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00091-s " data-id="e00091" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00091">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00092-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00092">Tuesday — Thursday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00093-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00093">4pm — midnight</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00094 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00094-s " data-id="e00094" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00094">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00095-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00095">Friday — Saturday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00096-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00096">noon — 2am</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00097 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e00097-s " data-id="e00097" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00097">
    			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00098-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00098">Sunday</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e00099-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00099">noon — 11pm</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0009a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009a">Two minutes from the tram, five from the station, and there is a bike rack in the yard. Kitchen stops at 11pm sharp. Over 21 after 8pm, so bring ID.</p>
					<p class="e-1c1mrqs-e0009b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009b">Quarter Inserted</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0009c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-1c1mrqs-e0009c-s " data-id="e0009c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0009c">
    
</div>

</div>
